	(property "Description" "The ball cup of ErgoCai.modules trackball/PMW3610, the trackball on the keyboard board itself (cup.js --fix screws, 3D printed), with its 25 mm ball and three 2.5 mm support balls in place. The cup is 28.4 mm round with a plate over the board, held by four M2 screws through the plate's corners and the board (TB_H1..TB_H4), nuts under it. Its Dwgs.User rectangle is the case cut-out over it: the plate with room for the screw heads, which the case's parts over the board cut (layers: [Dwgs.User], grown by 1.5 mm); no courtyard, as it sits over its own screw holes. No copper, nothing in the BOM. Origin on the ball's axis, the sensor's optical centre; the model is cup.js --fix screws --step, for the lens's reference plane 4.35 mm over a 1.6 mm board."
		(at 0 0 0)
